il access.GET /api/email/callbackPurpose: Handles OAuth callback, exchanges code for token, and stores email_connections.POST /api/email/syncPurpose: Triggers inbox fetcher for no-reply@famapp.in messages, parses fields via FamPay parser, runs deduplication check against transaction_id and email_id, writes valid transactions to database, recalculates metrics, and returns count/details of new transactions for in-app notification.4. Component HierarchyPlaintextRootLayout
